  "notes": "{定|さだ}める is formal and used in official/legal contexts.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Transitive ({他動詞|たどうし})\n- Intransitive pair: {定|さだ}まる (to be established, to be decided)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {法律|ほうりつ}で{定|さだ}める: to stipulate by law\n- {基準|きじゅん}を{定|さだ}める: to set standards\n- {規則|きそく}を{定|さだ}める: to establish rules\n- {目標|もくひょう}を{定|さだ}める: to set a goal\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {定|さだ}める: to establish, stipulate (formal, official)\n- {決|き}める: to decide (general, everyday)",
